                                                "example_id": "f6d0a7bc-e6d3-44fe-b745-b28a0496cd76",
                                                "sense_id": "a0efca4a-33c7-3962-bd7b-4e2b17381a47",
                                                "text": "As an archetypal image of primordial unity, the cosmic egg suggests that there is unity and fragmentation, eternity and time."
